  "prefLabel": "Rev 710.04 Form CD-3, Application for Meals and Rentals Tax Operator’s License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 710.04 Form CD-3, Application for Meals and Rentals Tax Operator’s License.\n\n(a) Every person seeking to serve taxable meals or rent rooms or motor vehicles shall complete and file a meals and rentals tax license application electronically or on paper Form CD-3, “Application for Meals and Rentals Tax Operator’s License”.\n\n(b) A separate application shall be filed for each license required under Rev 705.01.\n\n(c) If not filing electronically, the person applying shall submit Form CD-3 to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nCollections Division\n\nPO Box 454\n\nConcord NH 03302-0454.\n\nSource. #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 708.04); ss by #12907, eff 10-23-19; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev700.html"
